BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Can't Stop The Music (1980)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261209T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261209T205500
DTSTAMP:20261210T023000Z
UID:cant-stop-the-music-2026-12-09-18:30:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:We know the classic hit (“hits” if you’re really in the 
 know)\, but do we know how The Village People actually became the icons th
 ey’re known to be? In Nancy Walker’s very loose biopic\, we see the gr
 adual and fantastic transformation of a dream into a well-dressed (and hig
 h energy) reality. Can’t Stop The Music\, while filled to the brim with 
 nonsense that only the American 80s could produce\, is a landmark of Ameri
 can pop music cinema\, celebrating macho men\, milkshakes\, and fearless f
 ashion.\n\nNancy Walker\, United States\, 1980\, 124 min\, in English\n\nh
 ttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/cant-stop-the-music/\n\nEstimated start: 18:5
 0
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
