DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T212000
DTSTAMP:20261206T030000Z
UID:carol-2026-12-05-19:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:In this achingly beautiful drama\, a female department-store e
 mployee in 1950s New York falls for a woman stuck in a loveless marriage. 
 Unfortunately\, the latter’s husband threatens to take their child if th
 e relationship between the two women continues.\n\nTodd Haynes\, 2015\, Un
 ited States\, 118 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/carol/
 \n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
