BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Muscle (2K Restoration) (1989)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270115T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270115T175000
DTSTAMP:20270116T003000Z
UID:muscle-2027-01-15-16:30:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:Having just been released from prison after his relationship w
 ith sadistic bodybuilder Kitami (Simon Kunai) ended disastrously\, Ryuzaki
  (Takeshi Itô) begins working to tie up some loose ends from before he we
 nt in. But an obsessive longing for Kitami leads Ryuzaki into the seamy ga
 y underworld\, both to try to find out what happened to his ex and to trac
 k down a bootleg copy of his favorite filmmaker\, Pier Paolo Pasolini’s 
 final and most controversial film.\n\nLegendary filmmaker Hisayasu Satô
 ’s second gay-themed film\, Muscle (also known as Ostia: Lunatic Theater
 ) is a classic of transgressive queer cinema that took the North American 
 queer film festival circuit by storm in the 90s.\n\nNew 2K restoration by 
 Vinegar Syndrome.\n\nHisayasu Satô\, Japan\, 1989\, 59 min\, in Japanese 
 with English subtitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/muscle/\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 16:50
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
