DESCRIPTION:Have you always wished that Adam and Eve had their chance to s
 hine on America’s Got Talent? The Apple is just the movie for you! Follo
 wing the trials and tribulations of siblings Bibi and Alphie as they navig
 ate the deeply corrupt music industry in the distant future of 1994\, The 
 Apple is a fable that warns us all of the dangers that await when we unque
 stionably put stickers on our heads. Featuring sets\, costumes\, and produ
 ctions that far surpass any other aspect of this film\, The Apple is a mus
 ical that proves anyone can make a movie\, especially if they can blow eno
 ugh money on everything to make it pretty.\n\nMenahem Golan\, United State
 s & Germany\, 1980\, 97 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/
 the-apple/\n\nEstimated start: 19:50
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
